WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.940
How do you differentiate x² + 3x?

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.410
Do each part on its own.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:10.320
x² gives 2x.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.470
3x gives 3.

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:15.500
So the slope is 2x + 3.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.013
Sums split apart, and numbers in front just come along for the ride.
